				"code" : "chat\r\tsendMarkdown: 'There are some mathods with shadowed variables, such as `paper` in {{gtMethod:name=VSAuthor>>#reachableAuthorPaperGraphIn:}}. Rename the variable to eliminate the shadowing, and make sure there are no other shadowed variables in the GtVissoft2026 package.'"
